<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Weazel -->
  <Xeno_Weazel.label>鼬族</Xeno_Weazel.label>
  <!-- EN: Weazels are a 130cm-tall shortstack race of weasel clones. Thanks to their small size, they move very fast and have slightly better melee dodge. However, their mining yield and carrying capacity are very low.\n\nIn the beginning, there was probably only one Weazel in this world. Weazels call that very first Weazel the 'First-Alpha', and they admire and deify her. Just as the First-Alpha did, every Weazel dreams of raiding and battle and has a broad talent for engineering. After some unknown event, Weazels multiplied into enormous numbers through massive clone vats, and they now turn up all too often anywhere on the rim. What they seek is the thrill of raiding, and essence. Most of the technology Weazels use requires a resource called 'essence', and Weazels believe it can be extracted in especially large amounts from males.\n\nTheir bodies play a part in this belief. Although they are a clone race, Weazels can reproduce through ordinary means. Any Weazel can become pregnant by any genes, regardless of race, and the child is always born with the appearance of a female Weazel. Because of this, Weazels are obsessed with obtaining stronger males, and most Weazels think of males as little more than spoils of war. This obsession with essence and males eventually turned Weazel society into a slave society steeped in marriage by capture.\n\nWeazel society is a strict hierarchy. Weazels hold two kinds of rank. The first is merit rank, a status earned through particular achievements. In a society where everyone is a clone, even a small difference in status can carry great social weight. The second is a caste rank set by culture cycle. Every Weazel uses her serial number in place of a name. This serial number is instinctively imprinted the moment she is cultured, so a Weazel can tell another Weazel's culture cycle just by looking at her. Holding the First-Alpha sacred, Weazels built a strict caste system based on how genetically close one is to the First-Alpha. In short, the later a Weazel is cultured, the lower her caste. This rank is passed down to her children and can never change. That is why most Weazels tend to focus on breeding and increasing their numbers to raise the influence of their own caste. This has only deepened the Weazels' obsession with strong males.\n\nWeazels call the culture facility where they were cultured and mass-produced the 'Factory', and regard it as their spiritual home. Factories are spread all across the rim, so many that no one can even guess how many there are. All that is known is that every factory's serial number is assigned alphabetically. For example, the XCC Raid Battalion means the raid battalion from Factory XCC. -->
  <Xeno_Weazel.description>鼬族是身高130公分、矮小豐滿的鼬鼠複製種族。多虧體型嬌小，她們移動速度非常快，近戰迴避也稍高一些。不過，她們的採礦產量與搬運能力非常低。\n\n太初之時，這世上的鼬族大概只有一隻。鼬族稱那最初的鼬族為「初代阿爾法」，憧憬她並將她神格化。正如初代阿爾法一樣，所有鼬族都嚮往掠奪與戰鬥，在工程方面也有多樣的天賦。在某個不為人知的事件之後，鼬族透過巨大的複製培養槽繁衍出龐大的數量，如今在邊緣各處都經常能看見她們的身影。她們追求的是掠奪的快感，以及精華。鼬族使用的技術大多需要名為「精華」的資源，而鼬族相信雄性身上特別能抽取出大量精華。\n\n她們的身體特徵也助長了這種信念。雖然是複製種族，鼬族卻能以一般的方式繁殖。任何鼬族都能藉由任何基因懷孕，不分種族，而生下的孩子必定擁有雌性鼬族的外貌。因此，鼬族執著於取得更強的雄性，大多數鼬族把雄性看得不過是戰利品。這種對精華與雄性的執著，最終讓鼬族社會變成了帶有搶婚色彩的奴隸社會。\n\n鼬族社會等級森嚴。鼬族有兩種等級。第一種是功績等級，是憑特定成就取得的地位。在人人都是複製體的鼬族社會裡，即使是微小的地位差距，也可能帶來巨大的社會影響。第二種是依培養週期而定的階級。每個鼬族都以自己的序號代替名字。這個序號在培養的那一刻就本能地烙印在她身上，所以鼬族只要看一眼，就能分辨其他鼬族的培養週期。將初代阿爾法奉為神聖的鼬族，以與初代阿爾法的基因親近程度為基準，建立了嚴格的階級制度。簡單來說，越晚培養的鼬族，階級就越低。這個階級會傳給子女，而且永遠不會改變。因此，大多數鼬族傾向專注於繁殖、增加數量，以提升自己階級的影響力。這也讓鼬族對強壯雄性的執著更加深重。\n\n鼬族把自己被培養、量產的培養設施稱為「工廠」，並視之為精神故鄉。工廠散布在邊緣各地，數量多到沒人能猜出究竟有多少。唯一已知的是，每座工廠的序號都是依字母順序編排的。例如，XCC掠奪大隊的意思就是來自XCC工廠的掠奪大隊。</Xeno_Weazel.description>
